 ic Performance for <em>Contemporary Voices</em> (2020)\, featuring the wo
 rks of three Pulitzer Prize–winning women. In 2017\, the Quartet was ap
 pointed to lead the Center for Advanced Quartet Studies at the Aspen Musi
 c Festival and School. Formed in 1994\, the Pacifica Quartet quickly won 
